Variable	Purpose
positiveSpeechThreshold	Probability threshold for deciding speech started
negativeSpeechThreshold	Probability threshold for deciding speech ended / not speech
redemptionMs	How long silence can continue before ending speech
preSpeechPadMs	Keeps some audio from before speech detection
minSpeechMs	Minimum duration required for detected speech
submitUserSpeechOnPause	Whether detected speech should be submitted when VAD pauses